  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759236,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 101 DinoPets 3D: A Jurassic Adventure for Your Nintendo 3DS!\n\nGet ready for a prehistoric pet-tastic experience with *101 DinoPets 3D*! Adopt your very own adorable dinosaur and embark on a heartwarming journey of friendship and fun. Choose from over 101 unique dinos, each with its own personality, and nurture them from playful hatchlings to magnificent companions.\n\nTeach your dino tricks – from dancing and jumping to flying – and reward them with tasty treats! Dress them up in a dazzling array of hats, glasses, shirts, and more to showcase their unique style. Enter your dino into exciting pet shows to earn fantastic prizes like toys, food, and furniture.\n\nExperience the magic of 3D as you zoom, rotate, and interact with your dino up close and personal. Enjoy a variety of engaging minigames, including vet checkups, bubble baths, and playful romps in the yard. With endless possibilities for care, pampering, and adventure, *101 DinoPets 3D* offers hours of captivating gameplay for dino lovers of all ages!"
    },
